  "body": "Yes, it seems to work, i could no more crash ART, but ART seems to be more unresponsive. If the queue is busy, a click on the taskbar on windows does nothing or many seconds later. same with ALT+TAB. And then, clicking in ART like thumbnail overview, or editor takes very long. \n\nThe queue seems block ART. JXL 0.12 is out, i read in the changelogs that coding / decoding speed is much higher, so integrating 0.12 could improve the queue speed and reduce the lock times ...\n\nAnyway ... ART grows to my favourite editor, RT is much faster but lacks JXL export which is - i think so - the future. Thank you",
